@startuml UC11_MatchHistory_Sequence
title UC11 - Match History (Sequence Diagram)
note over Player
  **Under Development** — No dedicated MatchHistory screen exists.
  Currently only Player.PvPWins / PvPLosses counters exist.
  Detailed per-match recording and display is not yet implemented.
end note

participant "Player" as Player
participant "MainMenuScreen" as Screen
participant "GameSession" as GS

Player -> Screen: View PvP stats (future)
activate Screen

Screen -> GS: Get Player
activate GS
GS --> Screen: Player (PvPWins, PvPLosses)
deactivate GS

Screen --> Player: Display basic PvP stats

note over Screen
  Planned features:
  - Detailed match history per game
  - Turn-by-turn replay
  - ELO rating tracking
  - Opponent info
  
  Requires:
  - Match history data model
  - Repository persistence
  - Dedicated MatchHistoryScreen
end note

deactivate Screen
@enduml
